    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Maxime Belloc est un grand joueur de football, le meilleur buteur du championnat. Dans un geste de col\u00e8re il se brise la jambe... Son agent le contraint de se mettre au \u00abvert\u00bb le temps de sa convalescence chez son p\u00e8re \u00e0 qui il ne parle plus depuis 15 ans. L\u00e0-bas, \u00e0 sa grande surprise, Maxime va red\u00e9couvrir le sens des valeurs\u2026 et de la famille !",
        "english": "Maxime Belloc is a great football player, the best goal-kicker of the championship. Lashing out in a moment of anger, he breaks his leg... His agent obliges him to \"take a rest\", which leads him to convalesce at his father's place. Maxime hasn't spoken to his father for fifteen years. Back home, to his great surprise, Maxime rediscovers his values... and his family!"
